d for (Seed__Demo=true): tests and the factory's own checks start on an empty database\\n        if (app.Configuration.GetValue<bool>(\\\"Seed:Demo\\\")) SeedData.Run(db);\",\n     \"symbol\": \"Program\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"lineEnd\": 4,\n     \"lineStart\": 3,\n     \"path\": \"App.Api/SeedData.cs\",\n     \"quote\": \"// Sample rows for a person trying the product. The app calls Run at startup, after the tables exist, only when the setting\\n// Seed:Demo is true (the factory's run files set it; tests never do). Add rows to a table only when that table is empty.\",\n     \"symbol\": \"SeedData\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"lineEnd\": 16,\n     \"lineStart\": 13,\n     \"path\": \"App.Tests/HealthTests.cs\",\n     \"quote\": \"    public async Task ApiIsUp()\\n    {\\n        var res = await _factory.CreateClient().GetAsync(\\\"/\\\");\\n        Assert.Equal(HttpStatusCode.OK, res.StatusCode);\",\n     \"symbol\": \"HealthTests.ApiIsUp\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"id\": \"C-I4\",\n   \"spans\": [\n    \"I-4\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"The seed call is gated on Seed:Demo, and the seed-data comment says tests never set that setting. The current test only requests / and checks for HTTP 200; it does not assert or depend on seeded row counts or contents.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"anchors\": [\n    {\n     \"lineEnd\": 31,\n     \"lineStart\": 28,\n     \"path\": \"App.Api/Program.cs\",\n     \"quote\": \"app.MapGet(\\\"/\\\", () => \\\"API is up\\\").ExcludeFromDescription();\\n// The API's own document (/openapi/v1.json) and a page to read and try it (/swagger). Keep both: the factory's product page links to the page.\\napp.MapOpenApi();\\napp.UseSwaggerUI(o => o.SwaggerEndpoint(\\\"/openapi/v1.json\\\", \\\"API\\\"));\",\n     \"symbol\": \"Program\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"id\": \"C-I5\",\n   \"spans\": [\n    \"I-5\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"The current app exposes an API health endpoint and Swagger's API-reading/testing page; Program does not map feedlot product-screen routes. The UI visible from this app is Swagger, not product screens.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"header\": {\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-13T17:40:55.067Z\",\n  \"inputsHash\": \"\",\n  \"kind\": \"current-behaviour\",\n  \"producedBy\": {\n   \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n   \"stage\": \"ground\"\n  },\n  \"runId\": \"20261013-hackathon-problem-statement-fe-2bf7\",\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1\n },\n \"notFound\": []\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"spec\" kind=\"spec\" sha=\"\">\n{\n \"assumptions\": [\n  \"Interpret “a few” seed rows as 2 to 5 rows per application table; each row is based on an example for the corresponding entity in contracts/openapi.yaml.\"\n ],\n \"nfrs\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": \"NFR-1\",\n   \"metric\": \"100% of successfully acknowledged writes remain readable with the same persisted values after a process restart against the same App PostgreSQL database.\",\n   \"text\": \"Successful API writes to contract domain data use PostgreSQL durability and remain available after an API process restart.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"outOfScope\": [\n  \"Feedlot product screens and web-app UI implementation, which belong to the separate web-app repository.\",\n  \"Undocumented API paths and methods.\",\n  \"Additional authentication or role rules not explicitly declared by contracts/openapi.yaml.\"\n ],\n \"requirements\": [\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API is running and a client has valid contract inputs and any authentication context required by the contract.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-1.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Each response status and response body field matches the operation's declared contract, including success and error responses.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client calls each declared operation using its contract-defined method, path, parameters, and request body.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client calls a protected operation without valid authentication or without contract-required authorization.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-1.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is the contract-declared 401 or 403, as applicable, and no undeclared role rule denies an otherwise authorized request.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client calls that operation.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API host is running.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-1.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 404 for an undefined path or 405 for an unsupported method, and no feedlot product screen is displayed.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client requests an undefined path such as /yard, or uses an unsupported method for a contract path such as POST /dashboard.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Feedlot API shall implement every path, HTTP method, parameter, request and response schema, status code, and security rule declared in contracts/openapi.yaml, expose no undocumented API operations, and provide no feedlot product-screen routes or rendered screens.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-1\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"Q-1\",\n    \"Q-2\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has valid sign-in credentials and no bearer token.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the contract-defined accessToken and user fields, including declared permissions and authorizedYards.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /auth/sign-in with the contract SignInRequest body.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response user field contains the current user and contract-defined permissions.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /session.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Authorized dashboard data and a valid rankBy value of fcr, adg, or costOfGain are available.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rankingMeasure, bestLots, and worstLots correspond to the selected measure.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /dashboard with the selected rankBy value.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Lots have distinct pen, breed, sex, and status values and the client has a valid bearer token.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response lots list contains only rows matching the supplied filters and contract-defined fields.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots with supported query filters.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has the access required by the contract for GET /lots, and saved lots include a lot outside the client's authorizedYards that matches the supplied lot-list filters.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-2.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response lots list includes that matching lot with its contract-defined fields, without an additional authorizedYards restriction.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots with those supported query filters.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client requests sign-in, session, dashboard, or lot-list operations, the Feedlot API shall return the contract-defined authentication, current-user, dashboard, and filtered lot values.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-2\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-1\",\n    \"Q-6\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the source adapter is available.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response records field is a list of available procurement and receiving records.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /imports/source-records.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ImportRequest selecting source records.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains status, createdCount, updatedCount, records, and allocationConflicts fields reflecting the selected records and current matches.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /imports.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and valid PO-line-to-lot and lot-to-pen allocation quantities.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Both response statuses are 200 and the response poLines, lotPens, and pens contain the saved quantities, traceability status, and capacity information.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client calls PUT /allocations and then GET /allocations.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client submits an invalid selection, conflicting import, or allocation that violates saved state.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status and error response match the operation's declared 409 or 422 contract.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client submits the relevant import or allocation request.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client previews or imports procurement records or saves allocations, the Feedlot API shall return and persist contract-defined PO-line-to-lot and lot-to-pen traceability, including import matching and allocation-conflict results.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-3\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the lot forecast values, forecastBasis, and effective yard and lot assumptions.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/forecast.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ForecastSettingsRequest.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains persisted setting values; a subsequent forecast response contains the effective assumptions and projectedMarketDate declared by the contract.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends PATCH /forecast-settings or PATCH /lots/{lotId}/forecast-settings for an existing lot.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists with feeding and weight records where applicable.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains contract-defined metrics or suggestions with their basis, including null unavailable metric values where applicable.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/metrics or GET /lots/{lotId}/insights.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing lot, and a valid planner-selected insight action or WeightMeasurementRequest.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status and response fields match the contract, and the returned action or measurement is present in the subsequent relevant response.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /lots/{lotId}/insights/actions, GET /lots/{lotId}/weights, or POST /lots/{lotId}/weights as applicable.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client submits a weight measurement that fails contract validation, or requests forecast data or settings for a nonexistent lot.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is the contract-declared 422 with VALIDATION_ERROR for invalid measurement data or 404 with NOT_FOUND for a nonexistent lot.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends the applicable weight, forecast, or forecast-settings request.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client requests lot forecasts, forecast-setting updates, metrics, insights, planner actions, or weight-history operations, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined values, calculations, explainable suggestions, and persisted updates.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-4\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and inventory items or movements exist, or the inventory is empty.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains operationalTotals, items, movements, and contract-defined stock fields.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid InventoryItemRequest for creation or update.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for update and the response item contains the saved contract fields and stock values.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/items or PATCH /inventory/items/{itemId}.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid receipt or adjustment InventoryMovementRequest for an existing item.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response contains the saved movement and item with updated stock values.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/movements.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, a supported horizon, and inventory with applicable plans and wastage settings.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the selected horizon, projection rows with projected consumption and balance, and movement distinctions.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory/projections separately for daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semiAnnual, and annual horizons.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits an inventory request that fails contract validation or a projection horizon outside the contract enum.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends the applicable inventory write or projection request.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and authorized operational inventory rows exist.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.6\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains fileName, contentType text/csv, and a Base64 CSV file derived from operational records.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory/export.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an authorized client reads or changes inventory, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined stock, movement, projection, and export values and persist valid inventory changes in PostgreSQL.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-5\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"I-2\",\n    \"Q-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and saved ration definitions exist, or the ration collection is empty.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-6.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rations list contains saved ingredient, proportion, nutrition, cost, and approval fields.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client sends GET /rations.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid RationRequest for 